<div class="email-wrapper">
  <h1 class="email-heading">Your JobJournal email address was changed</h1>
  <p class="email-text">
    The email address on your JobJournal account was changed from <strong><%= @previous_email %></strong> to <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>. Any other sessions on your account were signed out.
  </p>
  <a href="<%= security_url %>" class="email-button">
    Review Active Sessions
  </a>
  <p class="email-footer">
    If this was you, you can ignore this email. If you didn’t make this change, someone may have access to your account. Sign in and change your email address and password right away.
  </p>
</div>
